# If the shared server has MCP_REQUIRE_SERVICE_TOKEN=true, configure your
# MCP client to send x-service-token or Authorization: Bearer from a private
# environment/secret store. Do not commit service tokens here. The server
# operator should include this host in MCP_ALLOWED_HOSTS.
